# Data files -- this repo is code-only; UK Biobank / proteomics data must
# never be committed. CSVs are excluded wholesale since git has no
# size-based ignore mechanism; force-add (`git add -f`) any small reference
# CSV that genuinely belongs in version control.
*.csv

# PLINK genotype files
*.bed
*.bim
*.fam

# Model weights / large binary artifacts -- excluded by default; the two
# reported trained checkpoints are force-added exceptions (see below).
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.weights.h5
!01_imaging/myocardium-unet-256.h5
!02_vae/cvae_16d_best.weights.h5

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp

# Manuscript drafts -- reference material for the assistant, not for the public repo
*.docx
